# Keep the worker build context (repo root -> worker/Dockerfile) lean. The worker image only
# COPYs worker/ + engine/, so everything else is excluded to avoid uploading web/node_modules,
# the .git history, baked media, etc. (This file is only consulted for ROOT `gcloud builds
# submit` — a `gcloud builds submit web` reads web/'s own ignore rules.)
.git/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.next/
**/.next/
web/
brand/
scripts/
**/frames-out/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.venv/
**/.venv/
venv/
**/.pytest_cache/
.pytest_cache/
*.mp4
*.webm
*.b64
*.log
